 "description": "<p>A punk-cut leather collar with a heart centerpiece, in black, pink, or red. The heart softens the hardware framing - this is the collision the design lives on.</p>\n<p>Leather construction in the standard collar build, three colorways from stark to warm. It pairs with punk and gothic outfits as readily as with intimate occasions, which is the versatility claim and the honest one.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Item type: collar</li>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Style: punk, heart centerpiece</li>\n<li>Color: black, pink, or red</li>\n<li>Fit: one size, buckle closure</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Three shades, one silhouette. The collar that bridges the costume drawer and the lingerie drawer.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Punk leather collar with heart centerpiece in black, pink or red, one-size buckle closure.</p>\n",
